    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Veryfi OCR API extracts structured data from financial documents including receipts, invoices, bank statements, checks, W-2s, W-8s, W-9s, business cards, contracts, and more. The API uses AI-powered OCR to capture line items, taxes, totals, barcodes, vendor details, and other financial data across 91 currencies and 38 languages with enterprise-grade accuracy.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Veryfi Support\n Email: support@veryfi.com",
